# Codebase Memory MCP

Use `codebase-memory-mcp` **before** Grep/full-file Read when exploring this repo.

Install (once): `curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeusData/codebase-memory-mcp/main/install.sh | bash`

Do **not** index `/workspace` or `legacy/`. Use:

| Work | `project` | `repo_path` |
|------|-----------|-------------|
| Packages / SDK / workspaces | `app-tour-packages` | `/workspace/packages` |
| Apps | `app-tour-apps` | `/workspace/apps` |
| Docs | `app-tour-docs` | `/workspace/docs` |
| Scripts / guards | `app-tour-scripts` | `/workspace/scripts` |
| Infra / SQL | `app-tour-infra` | `/workspace/infra` |
| Tokens | `app-tour-design-system` | `/workspace/design-system` |

Pass `project` on every graph call.

| Task | Tool |
|------|------|
| Definitions / routes / symbols | `search_graph` |
| Text + graph | `search_code` |
| Callers / callees | `trace_path` |
| Architecture | `get_architecture` |
| Uncommitted impact | `detect_changes` |
| Known symbol body | `get_code_snippet` |
| Multi-hop | `query_graph` |

Skip graph: editing a file user named; docs-only; one-off string in a known path.

Fallback if MCP empty: CLI `codebase-memory-mcp cli …` then `Grep`/`Read`. Say attach/index may be pending.
